WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.750
Every agent can make a video now.

2
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.350
It looks finished. Nobody checked a single frame.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.050
Stop.

4
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.540
Sizzle makes your agent a director first.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.020
Ideas before assets.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.220
It writes the film on paper, beat by beat.

7
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.240
Nothing is generated until it passes fifteen checks.

8
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.210
Then voice, score and sound.

9
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.670
Then it checks every word, and every beat.

10
00:00:41.412 --> 00:00:44.492
Direct the film. Measure every frame.

11
00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.000
Sizzle.

